---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Disclaimer | AKTU Result Independent Student Utility";
const pageDescription = "Legal disclaimer and non-affiliation notice for akturesult.bond, an independent student utility for Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University students.";
---

<Layout 
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-black light:bg-white text-gray-400 light:text-gray-600 text-left">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-8">
      
      <div class="border-b border-canvas-dark-border light:border-canvas-light-border pb-6 space-y-2">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">
          <span>⚖️ Official Legal Disclaimer</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white light:text-ink">
          Website Disclaimer &amp; Notice
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
          Last Updated: October 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Prominent Non-Affiliation Box -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300 light:text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-400 light:text-amber-800 uppercase tracking-wide">
          1. Independent Student Utility (Non-Affiliation Notice)
        </h2>
        <p class="font-medium">
          <strong>akturesult.bond is an independent student utility platform and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or officially connected to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU).</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          This website does not represent, act as an agent for, or claim authorization from Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University, Lucknow, the Uttar Pradesh Board of Technical Education, or the Department of Technical Education, Government of Uttar Pradesh.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-3">
          2. Informational &amp; Provisional Nature of Data
        </h2>
        <p>
          All examination scores, subject grades, SGPA, CGPA, and marksheet summaries presented through this platform are compiled for <strong>provisional reference and informational assistance only</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          While the search engine queries public result gateways to display current information, internet-retrieved result cards do <strong>not</strong> constitute a legal, formal, or final university transcript. Official academic transcripts, marksheets, division certificates, and migration documents are issued exclusively by Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University through your affiliated college registrar.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-3">
          3. Trademarks &amp; Proprietary Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          All trademarks, service marks, trade names, acronyms, and product logos referenced on this website—including but not limited to <em>"AKTU"</em>, <em>"UPTU"</em>, <em>"OneView"</em>, and college names—are the exclusive intellectual property of their respective owners. Their mention on this platform is solely for descriptive, educational, and nominative identification purposes, and does not imply endorsement, sponsorship, or association.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-3">
          4. Technical Limitations &amp; University Downtime
        </h2>
        <p>
          Because our utility interacts with external university gateways, we cannot guarantee continuous availability. During university result declaration cycles, official AKTU servers frequently experience server congestion, ViewState timeouts, maintenance blackouts, or database rollbacks. We accept no responsibility or liability for delays, temporary service interruptions, or server-side data discrepancies originating from official university servers.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-3">
          5. Official Resolution Channels
        </h2>
        <p>
          If your academic records show errors (such as missing internal marks, withheld results "WH", or unfair means flags "UFM"), our utility cannot alter or expedite these university records. Students must contact:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Their affiliated college Examination Controller or Dean of Academics.</li>
          <li>The official AKTU student grievance cell at <a href="https://erp.aktu.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-blue underline font-semibold">erp.aktu.ac.in</a>.</li>
          <li>The university campus registrar's office located at Sector-11, Jankipuram Vistar, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white light:text-ink border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-3">
          6. Contact Inquiries
        </h2>
        <p>
          For legal, operational, or editorial questions regarding this disclaimer, please reach out directly through our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-blue underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a> or via email at <a href="mailto:support@akturesult.bond" class="text-brand-blue underline font-semibold">support@akturesult.bond</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
